  "notes": "Issue #656. EXP-374 is frozen (same model, folds, seed, checkpoint policy, stop notation parser, pathways, hotspots, and Ensembl residue-position mask as EXP-374 itself). The only change is the isolated MMR-gene (MLH1, MSH2, MSH6, PMS2) observable marker proxy from EXP-653, reusing the unchanged ObservableMarkerFamily implementation with knowledge/mmr_gene_proxy_v1.json. EXP-653 tested the identical panel on the EXP-527 (class-cosine native) parent and passed the aggregate Macro F1 gate but collapsed LGG (-0.1304) and KIRC (-0.1071) well past the -0.05 threshold, ARCHIVE. This experiment checks whether the same panel is stable on the legacy EXP-374 parent, which has a much lower Local-Public shift_gap and has shown no KIPAN/KIRC or GBMLGG/LGG collapse in prior direct interventions on that axis (EXP-514, EXP-515, EXP-604). Target, test distribution and Public LB are not used to define the panel.",
